      "content": "---\ntitle: \"Gadgeteer's Gambit\"\nslug: \"gadgeteer-s-gambit\"\ntype: talent\nclassName: \"Artificer\"\nclassSlug: \"artificer\"\nclassCategory: \"Magical Classes\"\ntalentTier: \"Tier 1\"\ntier: \"Tier 1\"\nranks: 5\nprerequisite: \"None\"\ncost: \"3 TP to unlock; rank costs scale by progression rules\"\ncooldown: \"Passive\"\nscaling: \"Adds stronger and more flexible mechanical effects to crafted items by rank.\"\nsynergy: \"Pairs with gadgets, triggers, timers, devices, and engineered equipment.\"\ntags:\n  - \"talent\"\n  - \"artificer\"\n  - \"tier-1\"\nvisibility: public\nsourceOrder: 2\n---\n\n# Gadgeteer's Gambit\n\n## Overview\nAdds stronger and more flexible mechanical effects to crafted items by rank.\n\n## Rank 1\nUnlock Gadgeteering and add 1 simple mechanical effect to a crafted item.\n\n## Rank 2\nImprove gadget reliability and add more practical mechanical options.\n\n## Rank 3\nCreate more complex linked gadget functions.\n\n## Rank 4\nBuild advanced multi-step device effects.\n\n## Rank 5\nMaster compact gadget systems and high-complexity mechanical effects.\n\n## Prerequisites\nNone\n\n## Scaling\nAdds stronger and more flexible mechanical effects to crafted items by rank.\n\n## Synergy\nPairs with gadgets, triggers, timers, devices, and engineered equipment.\n\n## GM Notes\nInformation coming soon\n"
