      "content": "---\ntitle: \"Construct Creation\"\nslug: \"construct-creation\"\ntype: talent\nclassName: \"Artificer\"\nclassSlug: \"artificer\"\nclassCategory: \"Magical Classes\"\ntalentTier: \"Tier 2\"\ntier: \"Tier 2\"\nranks: 5\nprerequisite: \"Artificer Discipline Rank 2\"\ncost: \"1 Talent Point\"\ncooldown: \"Passive\"\nscaling: \"Construct slots, complexity, and capability improve by rank.\"\nsynergy: \"Core construct pathway for utility constructs, workshop support, and future companion systems.\"\ntags:\n  - \"talent\"\n  - \"artificer\"\n  - \"tier-2\"\nvisibility: public\nsourceOrder: 6\n---\n\n# Construct Creation\n\n## Overview\nConstruct slots, complexity, and capability improve by rank.\n\n## Rank 1\nUnlock Construct Creation and maintain 1 utility construct slot.\n\n## Rank 2\nImprove construct reliability and task range.\n\n## Rank 3\nCreate more capable constructs with better instructions.\n\n## Rank 4\nSupport advanced construct designs and multiple roles.\n\n## Rank 5\nMaster living workshop support through advanced constructs.\n\n## Prerequisites\nArtificer Discipline Rank 2\n\n## Scaling\nConstruct slots, complexity, and capability improve by rank.\n\n## Synergy\nCore construct pathway for utility constructs, workshop support, and future companion systems.\n\n## GM Notes\nInformation coming soon\n"
