      "slug": "bronze-ingot",
      "title": "Bronze Ingot",
      "category": "materials/1-common/metals/bronze-ingot",
      "source": "materials/1-common/metals/bronze-ingot/index.md",
      "content": "---\ntitle: Bronze Ingot\nslug: bronze-ingot\ntype: item\nkingdom: Material\nitem_class: Common\ncategory: Ingot\nsubcategory: Metal\nmaterial_type: Metal\nmaterial_form: Ingot (Alloy)\nmaterial_family: Bronze\nsource_items:\n  - Copper Ingot\n  - Tin Ingot\nweight: 1.1kg\nweight_class: Medium\ndurability: Moderate\nenchantment_affinity: \"20% (+1 dice)\"\nmarket_value: 12 Marks\ntags:\n  - items\n  - materials\n  - metal\n  - ingot\n  - common\nvisibility: public\n---\n\n# Bronze Ingot\n\n## Effect\nBronze is the first true crafted alloy, offering improved durability and strength over its base components. It is ideal for early weapons, armor, and durable crafted goods.\n\n---\n\n## Crafting Use\n- Weapons\n- Armor\n- Tools\n- Structural components\n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Stronger than Copper and Tin  \n- Holds shape and edge better  \n- Resistant to corrosion  \n\n---\n\n## Alloy Composition\n- 1x [[Copper Ingot]]\n- 1x [[Tin Ingot]]\n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Supports basic enchantments  \n- More stable than Copper  \n- Can hold longer-lasting effects  \n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires:\n  - 1x [[Copper Ingot]]\n  - 1x [[Tin Ingot]]\n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Where two weak metals meet, strength is born.\"*\n"
