      "category": "materials/1-common/metals/nickel-ingot",
      "source": "materials/1-common/metals/nickel-ingot/index.md",
      "content": "---\ntitle: Nickel Ingot\nslug: nickel-ingot\ntype: item\nkingdom: Material\nitem_class: Common\ncategory: Ingot\nsubcategory: Metal\nmaterial_type: Metal\nmaterial_form: Ingot\nmaterial_family: Nickel\nsource_items:\n  - Nickel Ore\nweight: 1.0kg\nweight_class: Medium\ndurability: Moderate\nenchantment_affinity: \"10% (+0 dice)\"\nmarket_value: 10 Marks\ntags:\n  - items\n  - materials\n  - metal\n  - ingot\n  - common\nvisibility: public\n---\n\n# Nickel Ingot\n\n## Effect\nNickel Ingots provide structural balance and resilience when used in crafting. While not ideal for standalone weapons or armor, they are highly valued for strengthening and stabilising alloys.\n\n---\n\n## Crafting Use\n- Alloy reinforcement  \n- Tool crafting  \n- Structural components  \n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Flexible yet durable  \n- Corrosion resistant  \n- Maintains integrity under stress  \n\n---\n\n## Alloy Use\n- Used to improve durability and stability in alloys  \n- Supports balanced metal compositions  \n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Reduces enchantment instability  \n- Improves consistency of magical effects  \n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires: 4x [[Nickel Ore]]\n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Strength is not always in force — but in what holds it together.\"*\n"
