      "source": "materials/2-uncommon/metals/aluminum-ingot/index.md",
      "content": "---\ntitle: Aluminum Ingot\nslug: aluminum-ingot\ntype: item\nkingdom: Material\nitem_class: Uncommon\ncategory: Ingot\nsubcategory: Metal\nmaterial_type: Metal\nmaterial_form: Ingot\nmaterial_family: Aluminum\nsource_items:\n  - Aluminum Ore\nweight: 0.6kg\nweight_class: Very Light\ndurability: Low\nenchantment_affinity: \"25% (+2 dice)\"\ndamage_modifier: 1\narmor_modifier: 1\nmarket_value: 18 Marks\ntags:\n  - items\n  - materials\n  - metal\n  - ingot\n  - uncommon\nvisibility: public\n---\n\n# Aluminum Ingot\n\n## Effect\nAluminum is an extremely lightweight metal that enhances speed, mobility, and responsiveness. It sacrifices durability for agility, making it ideal for fast-paced combat styles and aerial or evasive gear.\n\n---\n\n## Crafting Use\n- Light armor\n- Mobility gear\n- Artificer components\n- Flight / movement devices\n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Extremely lightweight  \n- Highly resistant to corrosion  \n- Poor durability under heavy stress  \n- Excellent electrical conductivity  \n\n---\n\n## Alloy Use\n- Lightweight alloys (future)\n- Speed-enhanced equipment\n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Enhances Air and Lightning effects  \n- Boosts movement-based abilities  \n- Reduces activation delay in enchantments  \n\n---\n\n## Combat Integration\n- +1 Damage Modifier (weapons)\n- +1 Armor Modifier (armor)\n- Increases mobility-focused builds (system-side)\n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires: 4x [[Aluminum Ore]]\n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Lighter than steel — faster than thought.\"*\n"
