      "content": "---\ntitle: Cobalt Ingot\nslug: cobalt-ingot\ntype: item\nkingdom: Material\nitem_class: Unusual\ncategory: Ingot\nsubcategory: Metal\nmaterial_type: Metal\nmaterial_form: Ingot\nmaterial_family: Cobalt\nsource_items:\n  - Cobalt Ore\nweight: 1.3kg\nweight_class: Medium\ndurability: High\nenchantment_affinity: \"35% (+2 dice)\"\ndamage_modifier: 2\narmor_modifier: 2\nmarket_value: 50 Marks\ntags:\n  - items\n  - materials\n  - metal\n  - ingot\n  - unusual\nvisibility: public\n---\n\n# Cobalt Ingot\n\n## Effect\nCobalt is a mana-reactive metal that amplifies energy flow through weapons and armor. It enhances elemental interactions while maintaining structural stability.\n\n---\n\n## Crafting Use\n- Enchanted weapons\n- Battlemage armor\n- Arcane conduits\n- Magical cores\n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Highly responsive to magical energy  \n- Stable under repeated enchantment use  \n- Naturally cool and conductive  \n- Resistant to arcane corrosion  \n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Enhances Lightning and Ice effects  \n- Improves enchantment efficiency  \n- Supports multi-enchantment builds  \n\n---\n\n## Combat Integration\n- +2 Damage Modifier  \n- +2 Armor Modifier  \n- Favours elemental and hybrid builds  \n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires: 4x [[Cobalt Ore]]\n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"It does not hold power — it awakens it.\"*\n"
