      "content": "---\ntitle: Gallium\nslug: gallium\ntype: item\nkingdom: Material\nitem_class: Unusual\ncategory: Ingot\nsubcategory: Metal\nmaterial_type: Metal\nmaterial_form: Liquid\nmaterial_family: Gallium\nsource_items: []\nweight_class: Light\ndurability: Very Low\nenchantment_affinity: \"20% (+1 dice)\"\nmarket_value: 25 Marks\ntags:\n  - items\n  - materials\n  - metal\n  - ingot\n  - unusual\nvisibility: public\n---\n\n# Gallium\n\n## Effect\nGallium is a fluid metal that responds to heat and magical input. It cannot form stable equipment but excels in reactive enchantment systems and arcane circuitry.\n\n---\n\n## Crafting Use\n- Arcane circuits\n- Enchantment matrices\n- Illusion-based devices\n- Alchemical systems\n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Melts at low temperature  \n- Cannot form stable weapons or armor  \n- Highly responsive to magical input  \n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Supports dynamic / shifting enchantments  \n- Useful in illusion and transformation systems  \n\n---\n\n## Combat Integration\n- Not usable for weapons or armor  \n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"It flows like thought — and changes just as easily.\"*\n"
