      "content": "---\ntitle: Thorium Ingot\nslug: thorium-ingot\ntype: item\nkingdom: Material\nitem_class: Unusual\ncategory: Ingot\nsubcategory: Metal\nmaterial_type: Metal\nmaterial_form: Ingot\nmaterial_family: Thorium\nsource_items:\n  - Thorium Ore\nweight: 1.6kg\nweight_class: Medium-Heavy\ndurability: Very High\nenchantment_affinity: \"45% (+3 dice)\"\ndamage_modifier: 3\narmor_modifier: 3\nmarket_value: 70 Marks\ntags:\n  - items\n  - materials\n  - metal\n  - ingot\n  - unusual\nvisibility: public\n---\n\n# Thorium Ingot\n\n## Effect\nThorium is a mana-charged metal that stores and releases energy. It enhances magical output while providing strong defensive properties.\n\n---\n\n## Crafting Use\n- Arcane armor\n- Energy weapons\n- Magical cores\n- Runic systems\n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Stores residual magical energy  \n- Resistant to heat and arcane decay  \n- Requires careful handling due to instability  \n- Dense and highly durable  \n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Enhances Radiant and Arcane effects  \n- Supports high-output enchantments  \n- Can store spell energy  \n\n---\n\n## Combat Integration\n- +3 Damage Modifier  \n- +3 Armor Modifier  \n- Favours magic-heavy builds  \n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires: 4x [[Thorium Ore]]\n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Power given form — and barely contained.\"*\n"
