      "slug": "abyssborn-undien",
      "title": "Abyssborn Undien",
      "category": "races/abyssborn-undien",
      "source": "races/abyssborn-undien/index.md",
      "content": "---\ntitle: \"Abyssborn Undien\"\nslug: \"abyssborn-undien\"\ntype: race\nraceCategory: \"Demi Races\"\nsecondaryCategory: \"Undien Races\"\ntertiaryCategory: \nplayable: true\nsize: \nmovement: \"12m (Walking) - 30m (Swimming)\"\nlanguages:\n  - \"Common - Aquatic\"\nmagicAffinity:\n  - \"Water Magic - Void Magic\"\nessenceAffinity: []\ntags:\n  - \"race\"\n  - \"demi-races\"\n  - \"undien-races\"\nimages:\n  male: \"assets/races/abyssborn-undien/abyssborn-undien-male-adult.png\"\n  female: \"assets/races/abyssborn-undien/abyssborn-undien-female-adult.png\"\nvisibility: public\nsourceOrder: 177\n---\n\n# Abyssborn Undien\n\n## Overview\n- Race Category: Demi-Race\n- Race Type: Spiritborn Humanoid\n- Parent Race: Abyssal Water Spirit × Humanoid\n- Playable: Yes\n- Rarity: Very Rare\n\n## Racial Features\n- Height Range:\n  - Male: 5'10\" - 6'5\" (155cm to 198cm)\n  - Female: 5'6\" - 6'1\" (170cm to 185cm)\n\n- Weight Range:\n  - 55 kg to 90 kg \n\n- Skin:\n  - Smooth aquatic skin adapted to abyssal depths\n  - Colour Range:\n    - Midnight Blue\n    - Deep Black\n    - Dark Indigo\n    - Abyssal Violet\n    - Black-Grey\n\n- Hair:\n  - Often appears to drift as though underwater\n  - Colour Range:\n    - Black\n    - Dark Blue\n    - Silver\n    - Deep Purple\n\n- Eyes:\n  - Large reflective eyes adapted for darkness\n  - Colour Range:\n    - Glowing Blue\n    - Silver\n    - White\n    - Violet\n    - Bioluminescent Cyan\n\n- Hands:\n  - Long fingers with slightly elongated joints  \n  - Slight webbing between digits\n  - Slight claw-like nails\n  - Slightly colder to the touch\n\n- Face:\n  - Sharper, more angular features\n  - Expressions often muted or difficult to read\n  - Subtle shadowing beneath the eyes \n\n- Ears:\n  - Elongated and thin, fin-like but more rigid\n\n- Markings:\n  - Faint natural bioluminescent patterns beneath the skin\n\n- Body:\n  - Lean athletic build\n  - Movement is smooth but unnatural—too controlled \n  - Exceptional swimming musculature\n\n---\n\n## Racial Characteristics\n| Characteristic | Buff/Debuff | Stat Rolls | Characteristics Tier Cap |\n| -------------- | ----------- | ---------- | ------------------------ |\n| Strength       | +1          | 4d6        | Tier 3                   |\n| Dexterity      | 0           | 3d6        | Tier 4                   |\n| Agility        | +2          | 3d6        | Tier 5                   |\n| Constitution   | 0           | 4d6        | Tier 5                   |\n| Endurance      | +1          | 4d6        | Tier 5                   |\n| Intelligence   | +1          | 4d6        | Tier 4                   |\n| Wisdom         | +1          | 4d6        | Tier 5                   |\n| Charisma       | -2          | 4d6        | Tier 3                   |\n| Luck           | 0           | 3d6        | Tier 5                   |\n\n---\n\n## Racial Traits\n### Amphibious Nature\nUniden can breathe both air and water, easily adapting between land and aquatic environments.\n\n### Waterborne Healing\nWhen immersed in a natural source of water (like rivers or rain), Undines are able to regenerate health quicker:\n- In combat: +3 HP per round  \n- Out of combat: +10 HP per round\n\n## Lore\nInformation coming soon.\n\n## Culture\nInformation coming soon.\n\n## Historical Figures\nInformation coming soon.\n\n## Settlements\nInformation coming soon.\n\n## Relations\nInformation coming soon.\n\n## Traits & Biology\n- Ignore difficult terrain while underwater.\n- No movement penalties in deep water.\n\n---\n\n### ✅ Bonuses\n- Enhanced Water Magic\n- Superior underwater combat\n- Exceptional darkvision\n\n### ⚠️ Drawbacks\n- Sensitive to bright sunlight\n- Reduced visibility in deserts and open plains\n- Social distrust from some coastal communities\n\n---\n\n## Gallery\nInformation coming soon.\n\n## GM Notes\nGM-only information coming soon.\n"
